<title>USA: Catherines Stores Corp Q4 shr loss $0.36.</title>
<headline>Catherines Stores Corp Q4 shr loss $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4			    Year</p>
<p>		    13 Wks	 14 Wks	 52 Wks	 53 Wks</p>
<p>		Feb. 1 1997   Feb. 3 1996  Feb. 1 1997 Feb. 3 1996</p>
<p> Net sales	$63,063    $67,803	 $268,002    $274,130</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>	     (2,645,000)  (2,511,000)    1,286,000    3,111,000</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
<p>  common share  (0.36)	 (0.32)	   0.17	   0.40</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>number of</p>
<p>common shares</p>
<p>		 7,249,218    7,823,071    7,570,788    7,853,590</p>
<p>NOTE: In Q4 of both fiscal 1996 and fiscal 1997, the company wrote down impaired assets related to stores whose expected future cash flows were less than company's current investment. In fiscal 1995, the company also recorded costs to close 12 underperforming stores. These write-downs and costs reduced pretax income by $1.0 million in fiscal 1996 and $2.7 million in fiscal 1995. After taxes, these write-downs and costs reduced earnings per share in fiscal year 1996 and 1995 by $0.07 and $0.23 respectively.</p>
</text>
